{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d661d783fdc7fead","type":"text","x":0,"y":-85,"width":323,"height":170,"text":"# 相机对焦与景深笔记\n\n[[camera_focus_notes|📄 原笔记]]"},
		{"id":"8e24676d3ad16795","type":"text","x":423,"y":-757,"width":400,"height":110,"text":"## 镜头对焦范围\n\n对焦范围由机械行程和光学物理共同决定：","color":"1"},
		{"id":"508c0b8b20a5fe58","type":"text","x":923,"y":-867,"width":287,"height":58,"text":"薄透镜公式：`1/f = 1/u + 1/v`","color":"1"},
		{"id":"60a351bed767e534","type":"text","x":1583,"y":-975,"width":314,"height":58,"text":"u（物距）：物体到透镜光心的距离","color":"1"},
		{"id":"3e9745074b1b89de","type":"text","x":1583,"y":-893,"width":400,"height":84,"text":"v（像距）：成像面（传感器）到透镜光心的距离","color":"1"},
		{"id":"f4fc617270ba0044","type":"text","x":1583,"y":-785,"width":400,"height":84,"text":"f（焦距）：透镜固有属性，三者参考点均为透镜光心","color":"1"},
		{"id":"090bbd92f703ad03","type":"text","x":923,"y":-677,"width":400,"height":84,"text":"物距越小 → 像距越大 → 镜片需要前伸更多 → 镜筒行程有限 → 存在最近对焦距离","color":"1"},
		{"id":"bc35fffe20a52614","type":"text","x":923,"y":-569,"width":368,"height":58,"text":"当 u < f 时无法形成实像（物理硬限制）","color":"1"},
		{"id":"512d92650b92a9df","type":"text","x":923,"y":-487,"width":349,"height":58,"text":"50mm f/1.8 典型对焦范围：0.45m ~ ∞","color":"1"},
		{"id":"af3e4abebfe61176","type":"text","x":423,"y":-198,"width":202,"height":72,"text":"## 景深计算","color":"2"},
		{"id":"b4c6ec63c3075780","type":"text","x":923,"y":-405,"width":560,"height":188,"text":"```\n超焦距 H = f² / (N × c)\n近界 D_n = u × H / (H + u)\n远界 D_f = u × H / (H - u)\n景深 DoF = D_f - D_n\n```","color":"2"},
		{"id":"b9f8230038ced45a","type":"text","x":923,"y":-193,"width":400,"height":84,"text":"f = 焦距，N = 光圈值，c = 弥散圆（全幅 0.03mm，APS-C 0.02mm），u = 对焦距离","color":"2"},
		{"id":"985240fb72e644f7","type":"text","x":923,"y":-85,"width":335,"height":58,"text":"景深与 N、u² 成正比，与 f² 成反比","color":"2"},
		{"id":"0d2bbeeebc08229d","type":"text","x":923,"y":-3,"width":400,"height":84,"text":"50mm f/1.8 在 2m 处景深仅约 17cm；收到 f/8 约 80cm","color":"2"},
		{"id":"b5ea1db77ae1d3d0","type":"text","x":423,"y":154,"width":400,"height":176,"text":"## 对焦范围 ≠ 一定能对上焦\n\n对焦范围是镜头的光学能力上限，实际能否合焦还取决于 AF 系统：","color":"3"},
		{"id":"dcd041731c9da0fe","type":"text","x":923,"y":105,"width":324,"height":58,"text":"AF 需要足够的对比度/边缘才能锁定","color":"3"},
		{"id":"6b8c7fafa01bb149","type":"text","x":923,"y":187,"width":400,"height":84,"text":"发光屏幕、纯色表面、低光环境会导致 AF 失败或对错位置","color":"3"},
		{"id":"d5d7d7b5ad685e0a","type":"text","x":923,"y":295,"width":400,"height":84,"text":"AF 不拉风箱不代表对焦正确，可能只是对错了地方并\"确认\"了","color":"3"},
		{"id":"ff9e4d71ba33d02f","type":"text","x":423,"y":410,"width":400,"height":148,"text":"## P 档 vs AF/MF\n\n两者独立，互不影响：\n\nP 档下默认仍然是 AF 自动对焦。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b6de35773ffe6c5b","type":"text","x":923,"y":403,"width":560,"height":162,"text":"| 控制项 | 选项 | 作用 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| 曝光模式 | P / Av / Tv / M | 控制光圈和快门分配 |\n| 对焦方式 | AF / MF（镜头侧面开关） | 控制自动还是手动对焦 |","color":"4"},
		{"id":"7a04bb0d0191c33c","type":"text","x":423,"y":727,"width":400,"height":110,"text":"## 拍屏幕对焦方案\n\n当 AF 无法正确对焦屏幕时：","color":"5"},
		{"id":"c3201fa33e5d414d","type":"text","x":923,"y":589,"width":206,"height":58,"text":"1. 镜头开关拨到 MF","color":"5"},
		{"id":"cb68eff076271daa","type":"text","x":923,"y":671,"width":201,"height":58,"text":"2. 开启 Live View","color":"5"},
		{"id":"6989ee3d54db6f5e","type":"text","x":923,"y":753,"width":264,"height":58,"text":"3. 按放大键放大到目标区域","color":"5"},
		{"id":"9da4796e2b90b3dd","type":"text","x":923,"y":835,"width":281,"height":58,"text":"4. 手动转对焦环直到边缘锐利","color":"5"},
		{"id":"086cd474276693ec","type":"text","x":923,"y":917,"width":196,"height":58,"text":"5. 退出放大，拍摄","color":"5"}
	],
